  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="967eb8fa-0b69-5479-a408-a297def5714b" activityNameId="247b631e-2c7d-5f94-9b5e-9798da59fdbc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="1">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, coal freight train, diesel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, coal freight train, diesel
Based on "operation, freight train, diesel" dataset for RER. Diesel use per tkm is from CN 2004 statistics (very low rate compared to European statistics), adjusted by a factor of two assuming that the original data are referring to gross tkm. This dataset should not be used for comparisons of locomotive types nor of transport means across different countries but only when transport is not a major contributor to total environmental burdens of a process or product being analyzed.;
UUID: 1a2e89a3-c59a-37b4-8ccd-8893aaa86310
Based on "operation, freight train, diesel" dataset for RER but with specific Chinese diesel consumption.
Location: RER operation model with specific CN diesel intensity.
Technology: Unspecified.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1a2e89a3-c59a-37b4-8ccd-8893aaa86310.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
